/-!
# Degree and shifted-root norm of a prime cyclotomic field

Source: Milne, Abelian Varieties, Chapter I, Lemma 14.5, printed p.63 (PDF p.69), proof.
(blueprint: lem-sfb-prime-cyclotomic-degree-norm)
-/

@[expose] public section

universe u

namespace IsPrimitiveRoot

/-- The subfield generated by a primitive prime-order root over the rationals is finite,
has degree `p - 1`, and the norm of the root minus one is `(-1) ^ (p - 1) * p`.
Source: Milne, Abelian Varieties, Chapter I, Lemma 14.5, printed p.63 (PDF p.69), proof.
(blueprint: lem-sfb-prime-cyclotomic-degree-norm)

Proof:
1. In `E = ℚ(η)`, put `x = η - 1`. By `lem-sfb-prime-root-shift-minpoly`, its minimal
   polynomial is `P(T) = ∑ j = 0, ..., p - 1, (T + 1) ^ j`, and `P(x) = 0`.
2. Since `p ≥ 2`, the last summand is monic of degree `p - 1`; every earlier summand
   has smaller degree. Hence `P` is monic, nonzero, and has degree `p - 1`. Its constant
   term is the sum of `p` copies of one, so `P(0) = p` (`def-weil-polynomial-ring`).
3. We have `ℚ(x) = E`: `x = η - 1` belongs to `E`, and `η = x + 1` belongs to `ℚ(x)`.
   The polynomial `P` makes `x` algebraic. The isomorphism of
   `lem-weil-pbc-minimal-polynomial-quotient-field-iso` identifies `E` with `ℚ[T]/(P)`.
   By `lem-weil-pbc-monic-quotient-free`, the classes of `1, T, ..., T ^ (p - 2)` give
   a basis. Thus `E/ℚ` is finite of degree `p - 1`.
4. Apply `lem-sfb-finite-field-norm-minpoly` to `x` in `E`. Its minimal polynomial
   has degree `p - 1`, constant term `p`, and `dim_{ℚ(x)} E = dim_E E = 1`.
   Consequently its determinant norm is `((-1) ^ (p - 1) * p) ^ 1`, as asserted.
   This also gives `-2` when `p = 2`. -/
theorem prime_adjoin_finrank_norm_sub_one
    {K : Type u} [Field K] [CharZero K] {p : ℕ} (hp : p.Prime)
    {η : K} (hη : IsPrimitiveRoot η p) :
    FiniteDimensional ℚ (IntermediateField.adjoin ℚ {η}) ∧
      Module.finrank ℚ (IntermediateField.adjoin ℚ {η}) = p - 1 ∧
      Algebra.norm ℚ (IntermediateField.AdjoinSimple.gen ℚ η - 1) =
        (-1 : ℚ) ^ (p - 1) * (p : ℚ) := by
  sorry

end IsPrimitiveRoot
